        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jaolo, ringmei nthuk pui jei,",
            "Ntao hei ni luang bam;",
            "Mikdui keiloumei pu jei 0({,",
            "Gun kumma phuanpui tuang (2).",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Gun kumma phuanpui bamkhou louna,",
            "Thou puni lou nimei guai 0({;",
            "Pap guai khiu than lou ni.",
            "",
            "2. Kanloumeipu kalvari ching khou,",
            "Rianra rianriu khang louKhou rui nthukpui jei patlou,",
            "Gun kumma phuan pui tuang (2).",
            "",
            "3. He mei geimei ta nuh puni,",
            "Hei jei hei luang bam khou;",
            "Nthukpui Nah ta ningmei rui,",
            "Gun kumma phuan puni (2).",
            "",
            "4. Poubaumei 0({ kei dat puni,",
            "Kamei nun ta lakhang;",
            "Nthukpui jei ningmei narui,",
            "Tingkauh ram la puni (2)."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
